INSERT INTO "PrivacyNoticeVersion" ("version", "text", "isMaterialChange", "publishedAtUtc", "updatedAtUtc")
VALUES (1, $notice$Privacy notice — version 1

This notice is for CreditWithFriends. We use your information to help people in your circles find and contact someone who holds a bank card they need for an offer.

When you join, we store your display name and the WhatsApp number you enter. Other members of your circles can see both, along with the bank cards you list, so they can recognise you and contact you. Your number is not verified. We store your circle memberships to decide who can see your information. People outside your circles cannot see it.

We store your Google email address and Google account ID to sign you in and keep your account linked to the same Google account if its email changes. Only you can see these in your profile. We do not show them to other members.

We record joins, invites, cards listed, searches and WhatsApp contact taps, linked to your account and circle. A WhatsApp tap records which member you contacted, and a search records the bank and card type you searched for, never the variant you typed. The owner sees counts by circle to learn whether the app is useful. Other members do not see these usage records. If you delete your account, we remove the link between you and those records, keeping anonymous counts.

You can see your information in your profile and change your display name and WhatsApp number there. You can withdraw your consent by deleting your account. Deletion removes your profile, cards and circle memberships from the live app and ends your sessions.

Deleted information may remain in our hosting provider's backups until they expire. Our database is stored in Singapore. Our hosting provider can restore it to any point in the past 3 days, and any backup copy we make by hand is kept for 7 days.

We never ask for a card number, CVV, expiry date or one-time password. Do not share any of these with anyone through the app or WhatsApp. Orders and repayment happen outside CreditWithFriends. We do not use third-party trackers.

For questions or grievances, contact us at {{OWNER_CONTACT_EMAIL}}.$notice$, true, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
